{"id":"peso","lemma":"peso","pos":"noun","rank":1143,"glosses":["weight (the force on an object due to gravitational attraction)","weight (a block of metal used in a balance)","weight class"],"ipa":"/ˈpeso/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pesos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-peso.wav","examples":[{"text":"No subas de peso.","en":"Don't get fat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440057"},{"text":"Costó alrededor de treinta pesos.","en":"It cost about thirty pesos.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594602"},{"text":"Voy a perder peso.","en":"I'll lose weight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/510115"},{"text":"Tom puede levantar pesos pesados.","en":"Tom can lift heavy weights."},{"text":"Ella ha perdido peso.","en":"She has lost weight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70035"}]}